  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> nên\n\t\t\t<ul><li>Diện tích <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msup><mi/><mn>2</mn></msup></semantics></math>.</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>15</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>20</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ul>\n\t\t\tNửa chu vi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Diện tích <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>25</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>19</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><msqrt><mn>51</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> m<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msup><mi/><mn>2</mn></msup></semantics></math>.<br>Số tiền bác Lan nhận được là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>150</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><msqrt><mn>51</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>330</mn></mrow></semantics></math> triệu đồng.<div class=\"paragraph-gap\"></div></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/702a2d6e41663491c1feda00cde4145207a1fb7e104c1fb60b1234d182ff0ef6.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
